      "page": 306,
      "ruku": 264,
      "hizbQuarter": 122,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2266,
      "text": "And mention in the Book [the story of] Mary when she withdrew from her family to a place towards the east.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 306,
      "ruku": 265,
      "hizbQuarter": 122,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2267,
      "text": "She screened herself from them, then We sent to her Our Spirit [Gabriel] and he appeared before her in the form of a perfect human being.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 306,
      "ruku": 265,
      "hizbQuarter": 122,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2268,
      "text": "She said, “I seek refuge in the Most Compassionate from you; [do not approach me] if you fear Allah.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 306,
      "ruku": 265,
      "hizbQuarter": 122,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2269,
      "text": "He said, “I am only a messenger from your Lord to grant you a righteous son.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 306,
      "ruku": 265,
      "hizbQuarter": 122,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2270,
      "text": "She said, “How can I have a son when no man has touched me, nor have I ever been unchaste?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 306,
      "ruku": 265,
      "hizbQuarter": 122,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2271,
      "text": "He said, “Thus it will be; your Lord says, ‘It is easy for Me; We make him a sign for people and a mercy from Us. This matter has already been decreed.’”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
